    "created_at": "2024-04-30T14:12:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-04-30T14:12:37Z",
    "body": "Right, we need to replace `[SameObject]`: #212.\r\n\r\nI'd also double check you really want `FrozenArray`. It uses rather dubious ES5 semantics and not as much is frozen as the name might lead you to believe. Generally I'd try to design APIs differently as to not require that.",
